      "reason": "declared per-profile scope is synthetic regular spherical grids and NCEP GFS025; other registered domains are excluded. Nearest SQL/value/source/state/options/layout/rebind, legacy points compatibility, inherited read_om/semantic-axis SQL, native official-reader parity, and inherited 005 region-input/limit checks passed on all three runtimes. Nearest SQL covers bind behavior, schema/name conflicts, states, residual filters and strict failures. Added combined-invalid probes lock four precedence edges in the current binder order: method options before required region arguments, region presence before CRS validation, CRS validation before collection parsing, and collection parsing before later grid/domain binding. Shared RegionCollection::Build native checks cover reachable count, oversized per-region/aggregate WKB-byte rejection, opaque-geometry allocation and WKB-form limits; per-region/aggregate vertex-count guards and the owned-input cap are unreachable under stricter WKB/count limits. No parser permutation cross-product or exhaustive precedence matrix is claimed; N2 remains blocked pending independent review",
